     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "En and ett",
     "texto": [
      "The Swedish noun can be common or neuter gender. You learn it together with its article: **en stol** (a chair), **ett rum** (a room).",
      "**Det finns** means «there is»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
